an update on some breaking news and  france germany and  italy have now joined the eu countries  to suspend  the roll out of the oxford astrazeneca  covid vaccine the head of the oxford  vaccine group  has reassured the public over its use  following reports of serious blood  clotting in four patients in norway the  french president emmanuel macron  has said the european watchdog will  issue a ruling on the oxford jab  tomorrow our science correspondent  thomas more joins me now  that list of countries suspending the  use of the vaccine for now getting  longer  thomas what's happening  which around a dozen countries around  the world that have suspended the  vaccine or suspended certain batches of  the vaccine  and it does all boil down to this link  with blood clots  now there have been a number of people  who have suffered blood clots  deep veins from boces and also clots in  the lung  after they've been vaccinated and there  have been  some of those that have died now  what isn't clear though that these were  actually caused by the vaccine and  that's why the european  medicines agency is looking at the  evidence it does seem to be  coming down to the statistics at the  moment and the  ema has said that so far out of five  million people to have had the vaccine  across the continent there have been  30 reports of blood clots now in a  population of that size  you'd expect one in a thousand or around  100 a week developing a blood clot  even without vaccination so you can see  why many experts will say well there  just isn't any evidence that is the  vaccine  that is causing this that it could be  many other reasons other medical  conditions  that people would naturally have and  just because there is this temporal  association with vaccination doesn't  mean that the vaccine caused it and  certainly the world  health organization is extremely  concerned that there is a bit of a  bandwagon now that people are  countries are pausing their vaccinations  uh waiting to see what happens when in  fact  people are dying from kovid every day so  this  link is leading to people giving up on a  vaccine which has a known  beneficial effect so the prime minister  also  in the uk has said that there's no  evidence to be concerned about here in  the uk that the rollout here in the uk  will continue  that every confidence in the safety and  the effect  of the astrazeneca vaccine
 

